                <start-time>00:03:34,025</start-time>
                <end-time>00:03:37,100</end-time>
                <translation>这果然和我们通常所想的宗教不同吧</translation>
                <original>やっぱり私たちの思う宗教とは違っていましたよね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="57" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:03:37,100</start-time>
                <end-time>00:03:38,250</end-time>
                <translation>似乎有些不同呢</translation>
                <original>ちょっと違いそうですね</original>
