            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="113" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:06:13,625</start-time>
                <end-time>00:06:17,009</end-time>
                <translation>但反而是从舍弃这一切的地方</translation>
                <original>むしろそういうことを全部捨てたところから</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="114" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:06:17,009</start-time>
                <end-time>00:06:20,350</end-time>
                <translation>开始起步的 才是西田的“自我” </translation>
                <original>始まっていくのが西田の自己だっていうことですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="115" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:06:20,350</start-time>
                <end-time>00:06:23,750</end-time>
                <translation>所以 在某种意义上 就是放下“我”</translation>
                <original>ですので私を手放していくってことなんですある意味では</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="116" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:06:23,750</start-time>
                <end-time>00:06:27,650</end-time>
                <translation>也可以说是从执着于“我”的状态中解放出来</translation>
                <original>私であろうとすることから開かれていくって言ってもいいんですけど</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="117" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:06:27,650</start-time>
                <end-time>00:06:31,460</end-time>
                <translation>这正是西田哲学中非常重要的地方</translation>
                <original>そこが西田の哲学の大変重要なところなんですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="118" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:06:31,460</start-time>
                <end-time>00:06:35,200</end-time>
                <translation>那么 这是说原本在自我的根基之处</translation>
                <original>これはだからそもそも自分の根底のところに</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="119" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:06:35,200</start-time>
                <end-time>00:06:37,275</end-time>
                <translation>就单纯地存在着“自我”吗？</translation>
                <original>シンプルに自己はあるということですか</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="120" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:06:37,275</start-time>
                <end-time>00:06:40,600</end-time>
                <translation>是存在的 但很多人都不知道这一点</translation>
                <original>あるんですけども多くの人はそれを知らない</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="121" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:06:40,600</start-time>
                <end-time>00:06:41,834</end-time>
                <translation>另外还有一点</translation>
                <original>あともう一つは</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="122" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:06:41,834</start-time>
                <end-time>00:06:46,325</end-time>
                <translation>所谓自我 终究不是仅凭自己的力量就能存在的</translation>
                <original>自己というものはやっぱり自分だけの力では存在していない</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="123" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:06:46,325</start-time>
                <end-time>00:06:49,000</end-time>
                <translation>人类就是群居动物嘛</translation>
                <original>なんか人間って群れで生きる動物じゃないですか</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="124" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:06:49,000</start-time>
                <end-time>00:06:51,600</end-time>
                <translation>也就是说 在人类的根基之处</translation>
                <original>ってことは人間の根底には</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="125" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:06:51,600</start-time>
                <end-time>00:06:54,540</end-time>
                <translation>被编入了能够作为群体正确行动的</translation>
                <original>群れがとしてきちんと行動できるように</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="126" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:06:54,540</start-time>
                <end-time>00:06:56,350</end-time>
                <translation>就像是被预先编程了似的</translation>
                <original>プログラマーされているような気がするんです</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="127" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:06:56,350</start-time>
                <end-time>00:07:00,950</end-time>
                <translation>但如果它有了奇怪的智慧</translation>
                <original>だけどそれを何か変に知恵つけたり</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="128" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:07:00,950</start-time>
                <end-time>00:07:02,925</end-time>
                <translation>或是错误的欲望开始发动</translation>
                <original>間違った欲が発動したりすると</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="129" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:07:02,925</start-time>
                <end-time>00:07:05,125</end-time>
                <translation>就会做出伤害群体的事情</translation>
                <original>それを傷つけるようなことをするし</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="130" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:07:05,125</start-time>
                <end-time>00:07:08,375</end-time>
                <translation>甚至感觉连它自己的环境也会被弄得一团糟</translation>
                <original>ごと環境もおかしくしたりとかしていくような気がするんです</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="131" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:07:08,375</start-time>
                <end-time>00:07:11,350</end-time>
                <translation>这样一来 原本在自我根底里流淌着的</translation>
                <original>そうすると根底にもともと流れているのは</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="132" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:07:11,350</start-time>
                <end-time>00:07:14,120</end-time>
                <translation>以群体形式</translation>
                <original>群れとして</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="133" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:07:14,120</start-time>
                <end-time>00:07:19,060</end-time>
                <translation>采取符合自然规律的行动 才是先天的设计吧</translation>
                <original>自然の節理にかなった行動をするようにはできているのではないかと</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="134" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:07:19,060</start-time>
                <end-time>00:07:20,375</end-time>
                <translation>正是如此</translation>
                <original>そうなんですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="135" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:07:20,375</start-time>
                <end-time>00:07:24,650</end-time>
                <translation>所以 当我们过于想要做自己的时候</translation>
                <original>ですので私たちはあまりに自分らしくあろうとするとき</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="136" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:07:24,650</start-time>
                <end-time>00:07:28,075</end-time>
                <translation>反而会变得不像自己</translation>
                <original>かえって自分らしくなくなるんだと思うんですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="137" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:07:28,075</start-time>
                <end-time>00:07:30,400</end-time>
                <translation>我有点明白了 想要做自己</translation>
                <original>ちょっとわかります自分らしくなろう</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="138" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:07:30,400</start-time>
                <end-time>00:07:32,618</end-time>
                <translation>自己应该是这样的 人应该是这样的</translation>
                <original>自分ってこうなんだろう人間ってこうなんだろう</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="139" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:07:32,618</start-time>
                <end-time>00:07:33,740</end-time>
                <translation>一旦思考起这些</translation>
                <original>ということを考えると</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="140" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:07:33,740</start-time>
                <end-time>00:07:38,575</end-time>
                <translation>-就会变得越来越不自然　-变得越来越不自然 就是这么回事吧</translation>
                <original>-それはどんどん不自然に　-不自然になっていくそういうことですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="141" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:07:38,575</start-time>
                <end-time>00:07:40,400</end-time>
                <translation>因为我们是不完美的</translation>
                <original>私たちは不完全なので</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="142" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:07:40,400</start-time>
                <end-time>00:07:42,725</end-time>
                <translation>所以自己认为正确的事情</translation>
                <original>自分が正しいと思うことが</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="143" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:07:42,725</start-time>
                <end-time>00:07:45,575</end-time>
                <translation>终究不是绝对的善</translation>
                <original>絶対の善ではやっぱりないんだと思うんです</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="144" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:07:45,575</start-time>
                <end-time>00:07:47,375</end-time>
                <translation>对那个人来说是好事</translation>
                <original>その人にとって良いこと</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="145" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:07:47,375</start-time>
                <end-time>00:07:50,000</end-time>
                <translation>但从意见不同的人看来</translation>
                <original>ですけども意見の違う人からしてみれば</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="146" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:07:50,000</start-time>
                <end-time>00:07:52,650</end-time>
                <translation>也可能完全相反</translation>
                <original>それが正反対になることもありますね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="147" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:07:52,650</start-time>
                <end-time>00:07:56,300</end-time>
                <translation>因此 当我们站在哲学的起点时</translation>
                <original>ですので私たちは哲学の原点に立つときに</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="148" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:07:56,300</start-time>
                <end-time>00:07:58,277</end-time>
                <translation>在自己心中
自分の中に</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="149" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:07:58,277</start-time>
                <end-time>00:08:00,000</end-time>
                <translation>当下 就在当下呢 在自己之中</translation>
                <original>今今ですね自分の中に</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="150" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:08:00,000</start-time>
                <end-time>00:08:02,148</end-time>
                <translation>当下的自己心中是没有绝对的事物的</translation>
                <original>今ここに絶対的なものはないんだ</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="151" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:08:02,148</start-time>
                <end-time>00:08:05,084</end-time>
                <translation>从这一点出发是非常重要的吧</translation>
                <original>というところからスタートするのはとても重要なんじゃないか</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="152" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:08:05,084</start-time>
                <end-time>00:08:07,140</end-time>
                <translation>这是我的理解呢</translation>
                <original>なというふうに思うわけなんですよね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="153" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:08:10,225</start-time>
                <end-time>00:08:15,000</end-time>
                <translation>善是行为</translation>
                <original>善は行為である</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="154" torder="1">
                <marks>
                    <mark top="">默认标记</mark>
                </marks>
                <start-time>00:08:15,740</start-time>
                <end-time>00:08:17,575</end-time>
                <translation>所谓善</translation>
                <original>善とは</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="155" torder="1">
                <marks>
                    <mark top="">默认标记</mark>
                </marks>
                <start-time>00:08:17,575</start-time>
                <end-time>00:08:22,725</end-time>
                <translation>是指满足自我的内在要求
自己の内面的要求を満足するものを言うので</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="156" torder="1">
                <marks>
                    <mark top="">默认标记</mark>
                </marks>
                <start-time>00:08:22,725</start-time>
                <end-time>00:08:25,225</end-time>
                <translation>满足这一要求</translation>
                <original>これを満足すること</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="157" torder="1">
                <marks>
                    <mark top="">默认标记</mark>
                </marks>
                <start-time>00:08:25,225</start-time>
                <end-time>00:08:28,920</end-time>
                <translation>即人格的实现</translation>
                <original>すなわち人格の実現というのが</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="158" torder="1">
                <marks>
                    <mark top="">默认标记</mark>
                </marks>
                <start-time>00:08:28,920</start-time>
                <end-time>00:08:33,725</end-time>
                <translation>对我们而言是绝对的善</translation>
                <original>我々にといて絶対的善である</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="159" torder="1">
                <marks>
                    <mark top="">默认标记</mark>
                </marks>
                <start-time>00:08:33,725</start-time>
                <end-time>00:08:37,550</end-time>
                <translation>而这种人格的要求</translation>
                <original>しかしてこの人格の要求とは</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="160" torder="1">
                <marks>
                    <mark top="">默认标记</mark>
                </marks>
                <start-time>00:08:37,550</start-time>
                <end-time>00:08:40,740</end-time>
                <translation>既是意识的统一力</translation>
                <original>意識の統一力であるとともに</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="161" torder="1">
                <marks>
                    <mark top="">默认标记</mark>
                </marks>
                <start-time>00:08:40,740</start-time>
                <end-time>00:08:47,136</end-time>
                <translation>也是去发现实在根底里那无限统一力量
実在の根底における無限なる統一力の発現である</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="162" torder="1">
                <marks>
                    <mark top="">默认标记</mark>
                </marks>
                <start-time>00:08:47,136</start-time>
                <end-time>00:08:51,500</end-time>
                <translation>如果善是如此之物</translation>
                <original>善はかくの如きものであるとすれば</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="163" torder="1">
                <marks>
                    <mark top="">默认标记</mark>
                </marks>
                <start-time>00:08:51,500</start-time>
                <end-time>00:08:58,901</end-time>
                <translation>我想由此便可界定何为善的行为</translation>
                <original>これより善行為とはいかなる行為であるかを定めることができると思う</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="164" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:08:59,509</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:04,652</end-time>
                <translation>善不是可思考的 而是表现出来的</translation>
                <original>善とは考えるものではなく表すもの</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="165" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:09:04,652</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:11,317</end-time>
                <translation>是应通过行为来体现的</translation>
                <original>行為によって体現されるべきものだと西田は考えました</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="166" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:09:11,317</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:18,306</end-time>
                <translation>这种行为与我们平常的行动不同</translation>
                <original>その行為とは私たちの普段の行動とは違います</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="167" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:09:18,306</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:21,538</end-time>
                <translation>当表层意识与深层意识合而为一
表層意識と深層意識が一つになり</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="168" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:09:21,538</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:23,275</end-time>
                <translation>并付诸行动时</translation>
                <original>行為するとき</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="169" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:09:23,275</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:27,300</end-time>
                <translation>通往善的道路才会首次开启</translation>
                <original>初めて善への道が開かれるというのです</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="170" torder="1">
                <marks>
                    <mark top="">默认标记</mark>
                </marks>
                <start-time>00:09:29,966</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:34,708</end-time>
                <translation>富贵、权力、健康、技能、学识</translation>
                <original>富貴権力健康技能学識も</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="171" torder="1">
                <marks>
                    <mark top="">默认标记</mark>
                </marks>
                <start-time>00:09:34,708</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:38,829</end-time>
                <translation>其本身并非善</translation>
                <original>それ自身において善なるのではない</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="172" torder="1">
                <marks>
                    <mark top="">默认标记</mark>
                </marks>
                <start-time>00:09:38,829</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:42,424</end-time>
                <translation>若违背了人格的要求</translation>
                <original>もし人格的要求に反したときには</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="173" torder="1">
                <marks>
                    <mark top="">默认标记</mark>
                </marks>
                <start-time>00:09:42,424</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:45,010</end-time>
                <translation>反而会成为恶</translation>
                <original>かえって悪となる</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="174" torder="1">
                <marks>
                    <mark top="">默认标记</mark>
                </marks>
                <start-time>00:09:45,010</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:48,565</end-time>
                <translation>因此 绝对的善行
そこで絶対的善行とは</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="175" torder="1">
                <marks>
                    <mark top="">默认标记</mark>
                </marks>
                <start-time>00:09:48,565</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:52,079</end-time>
                <translation>必须以人格的实现本身为目的</translation>
                <original>人格の実現そのものを目的とした</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="176" torder="1">
                <marks>
                    <mark top="">默认标记</mark>
                </marks>
                <start-time>00:09:52,079</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:57,700</end-time>
                <translation>即必须是为意识统一本身而行动的行为</translation>
                <original>すなわち意識統一そのもののために働いた行為でなければならぬ</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="177" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:10:00,366</start-time>
                <end-time>00:10:02,462</end-time>
                <translation>所谓人格的要求
人格的要求とは</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="178" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:10:02,462</start-time>
                <end-time>00:10:07,633</end-time>
                <translation>是使人之所以为人的作用</translation>
                <original>人間を人間たらしめている働きのことです</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="179" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:10:07,633</start-time>
                <end-time>00:10:09,733</end-time>
                <translation>当遵从它时</translation>
                <original>それに従っているとき</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="180" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:10:09,733</start-time>
                <end-time>00:10:13,571</end-time>
                <translation>我们不仅能成就自己</translation>
                <original>私たちは自ら自分だけでなく</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="181" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:10:13,571</start-time>
                <end-time>00:10:18,258</end-time>
                <translation>也能超越自身 触及他人的存在</translation>
                <original>他者の存在も遠飛ぶことができます</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="182" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:10:18,258</start-time>
                <end-time>00:10:22,000</end-time>
                <translation>然而 当违背人格的要求时</translation>
                <original>しかし人格的要求に反したとき</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="183" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:10:22,000</start-time>
                <end-time>00:10:26,580</end-time>
                <translation>即无法尊重他人时</translation>
                <original>つまり他人を尊ぶことができないとき</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="184" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:10:26,580</start-time>
                <end-time>00:10:29,060</end-time>
                <translation>即便是健康或学识等</translation>
                <original>たとえ健康や学識など</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="185" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:10:29,060</start-time>
                <end-time>00:10:31,387</end-time>
                <translation>看似为善之物</translation>
                <original>一見善なるものでも</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="186" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:10:31,387</start-time>
                <end-time>00:10:36,599</end-time>
                <translation>也极易与恶相连 西田为我们敲响了警钟</translation>
                <original>容易に悪とつながると西田は警鐘を鳴らすのです</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="187" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:10:38,538</start-time>
                <end-time>00:10:41,260</end-time>
                <translation>善 在于行动之时</translation>
                <original>善は行為しているときに</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="188" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:10:41,260</start-time>
                <end-time>00:10:43,240</end-time>
                <translation>刚才提到过 不是“思考”</translation>
                <original>ってありましたね思うのじゃなく</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="189" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:10:43,240</start-time>
                <end-time>00:10:47,506</end-time>
                <translation>要注意到不是 “不思考的状态”就叫“行为”</translation>
                <original>要は考えているだけではない状態が行為</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="190" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:10:47,506</start-time>
                <end-time>00:10:49,940</end-time>
                <translation>还有一点</translation>
                <original>あともう一つは</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="191" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:10:49,940</start-time>
                <end-time>00:10:53,525</end-time>
                <translation>在行为发生时 必然存在“他者”</translation>
                <original>行為のときには必ず他者がいるんです</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="192" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:10:53,525</start-time>
                <end-time>00:10:56,280</end-time>
                <translation>关于西田所说的“他者”</translation>
                <original>ちょっと西田のよける他者というのをですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="193" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:10:56,280</start-time>
                <end-time>00:10:59,360</end-time>
                <translation>为了稍作解说</translation>
                <original>少し解説するのに</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="194" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:10:59,360</start-time>
                <end-time>00:11:00,580</end-time>
                <translation>我今天准备了这个</translation>
                <original>今日準備したんですが</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="195" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:11:00,580</start-time>
                <end-time>00:11:04,069</end-time>
                <translation>这是曾在本节目出场过的河合隼雄老师</translation>
                <original>この番組でも終わりになった河合隼雄さん</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="196" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:11:04,069</start-time>
                <end-time>00:11:06,700</end-time>
                <translation>也就是将荣格心理学介绍到日本的</translation>
                <original>日本にユング心理学を紹介してくださった</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="197" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:11:06,700</start-time>
                <end-time>00:11:08,352</end-time>
                <translation>那位先生所绘的图</translation>
                <original>方の図なんですけども</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="198" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:11:08,352</start-time>
                <end-time>00:11:10,620</end-time>
                <translation>河合或者说荣格</translation>
                <original>河合さんあるいはユングがですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="199" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:11:10,620</start-time>
                <end-time>00:11:12,905</end-time>
                <translation>认为意识是这样分层的</translation>
                <original>意識ってのはこういうふうに層をなしている</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="200" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:11:12,905</start-time>
                <end-time>00:11:15,179</end-time>
                <translation>他是这么考虑的</translation>
                <original>というふうに彼は考えたわけなんですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="201" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:11:15,179</start-time>
                <end-time>00:11:17,293</end-time>
                <translation>我们通常提到意识</translation>
                <original>で我々は普通意識というと</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="202" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:11:17,293</start-time>
                <end-time>00:11:20,565</end-time>
                <translation>往往容易想到个人的意识</translation>
                <original>なんか個人の意識のことを考えがちですけども</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="203" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:11:20,565</start-time>
                <end-time>00:11:23,399</end-time>
                <translation>但在我们心灵的深处</translation>
                <original>私たちの心の深いところでは</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="204" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:11:23,399</start-time>
                <end-time>00:11:26,480</end-time>
                <translation>原本就与他人相连</translation>
                <original>もともと他者とつながっているんじゃないか</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="205" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:11:26,480</start-time>
                <end-time>00:11:28,740</end-time>
                <translation>这就是荣格的想法</translation>
                <original>というのがユングという人が考え</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="206" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:11:28,740</start-time>
                <end-time>00:11:31,234</end-time>
                <translation>也是河合先生的想法</translation>
                <original>そして河合さんが考えたことなんです</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="207" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:11:31,234</start-time>
                <end-time>00:11:33,401</end-time>
                <translation>参照这个图就能理解到 西田所说的“善”</translation>
                <original>ですので西田が言う善というのは</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="208" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:11:33,401</start-time>
                <end-time>00:11:35,340</end-time>
                <translation>并非在此处（表层）进行</translation>
                <original>ここで行うことではなくて</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="209" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:11:35,340</start-time>
                <end-time>00:11:37,048</end-time>
                <translation>而是深入到这里</translation>
                <original>ここまで入ってきて</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="210" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:11:37,048</start-time>
                <end-time>00:11:39,840</end-time>
                <translation>当我们内在的东西开花结果时</translation>
                <original>我々の中にあるものが開花したら</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="211" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:11:39,840</start-time>
                <end-time>00:11:41,924</end-time>
                <translation>那会不会就是某种（善）呢</translation>
                <original>何かなんじゃないだろうか</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="212" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:11:41,924</start-time>
                <end-time>00:11:43,440</end-time>
                <translation>我们果然还是</translation>
                <original>私たちはやっぱり</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="213" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:11:43,440</start-time>
                <end-time>00:11:45,404</end-time>
                <translation>拥有越往深处走</translation>
                <original>深くなれば深くなるほど</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="214" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:11:45,404</start-time>
                <end-time>00:11:49,551</end-time>
                <translation>就越能开放自我的习性</translation>
                <original>開かれていくという習性を持っているんです</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="215" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:11:49,551</start-time>
                <end-time>00:11:51,301</end-time>
                <translation>在这里 最让我们</translation>
                <original>一番ここで私たちが</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="216" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:11:51,301</start-time>
                <end-time>00:11:53,718</end-time>
                <translation>感到束缚的 就是“愤怒”了</translation>
                <original>がんじがらめになるのはもう怒りですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="217" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:11:53,718</start-time>
                <end-time>00:11:54,927</end-time>
                <translation>原来如此</translation>
                <original>なるほど</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="218" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:11:54,927</start-time>
                <end-time>00:11:56,406</end-time>
                <translation>在愤怒的时候</translation>
                <original>もう怒っているときは</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="219" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:11:56,406</start-time>
                <end-time>00:11:57,865</end-time>
                <translation>我们已经处于非常狭隘的境地了</translation>
                <original>もうとっても狭いところにいる</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="220" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:11:57,865</start-time>
                <end-time>00:12:00,440</end-time>
                <translation>但是 当我们稍微深入自己的内心时</translation>
                <original>でも私たちはもう少し心を深めていくと</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="221" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:12:00,440</start-time>
                <end-time>00:12:03,887</end-time>
                <translation>就会与素不相识的人产生深刻的联系</translation>
                <original>未知の人たちと深くつながったりするわけですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="222" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:12:03,887</start-time>
                <end-time>00:12:07,242</end-time>
                <translation>因此 西田认为 作为第一步</translation>
                <original>ですので西田はまず一つのステップとしては</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="223" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:12:07,242</start-time>
                <end-time>00:12:10,118</end-time>
                <translation>就是要脱离那个狭隘意义上的“自我”</translation>
                <original>小さな意味での私から離れていくことだ</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="224" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:12:10,118</start-time>
                <end-time>00:12:12,055</end-time>
                <translation>他是这么说的</translation>
                <original>ということは言ってますよね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="225" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:12:12,055</start-time>
                <end-time>00:12:13,014</end-time>
                <translation>另一点是</translation>
                <original>もう一つは</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="226" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:12:13,014</start-time>
                <end-time>00:12:15,473</end-time>
                <translation>那里必然存在着“他者”</translation>
                <original>そこには必ず他者がいるんだ</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="227" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:12:15,473</start-time>
                <end-time>00:12:19,203</end-time>
                <translation>至少 如果现在自己所想的</translation>
                <original>少なくとも今自分が思っていることが</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="228" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:12:19,203</start-time>
                <end-time>00:12:23,287</end-time>
                <translation>完全只考虑自己的话</translation>
                <original>全くもって自分のことしか考えていない場合は</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="229" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:12:23,287</start-time>
                <end-time>00:12:25,642</end-time>
                <translation>那就离西田所说的“普遍无意识”
西田の言うところの普遍的無意識</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="230" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:12:25,642</start-time>
                <end-time>00:12:28,413</end-time>
                <translation>或者说那种“善”的人格</translation>
                <original>もしくはその善の人格には</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="231" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:12:28,413</start-time>
                <end-time>00:12:30,120</end-time>
                <translation>还差得很远</translation>
                <original>到底近づいていないということですよね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="232" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:12:30,120</start-time>
                <end-time>00:12:31,685</end-time>
                <translation>这很难啊</translation>
                <original>難しいですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="233" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:12:31,685</start-time>
                <end-time>00:12:35,144</end-time>
                <translation>此外 西田还写道 行为深处的东西</translation>
                <original>さらにですね行為の奥にあるもの</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="234" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:12:35,144</start-time>
                <end-time>00:12:38,800</end-time>
                <translation>隐藏在其中的东西才是重要的</translation>
                <original>潜むものが大切だと西田はこう書いているんです</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="235" torder="1">
                <marks>
                    <mark top="">默认标记</mark>
                </marks>
                <start-time>00:12:40,821</start-time>
                <end-time>00:12:45,167</end-time>
                <translation>富贵、权力、健康、技能、学识
富貴、権力、健康、技能、学識も</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="236" torder="1">
                <marks>
                    <mark top="">默认标记</mark>
                </marks>
                <start-time>00:12:45,167</start-time>
                <end-time>00:12:46,360</end-time>
                <translation>这些东西本身</translation>
                <original>それ自身において</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="237" torder="1">
                <marks>
                    <mark top="">默认标记</mark>
                </marks>
                <start-time>00:12:46,360</start-time>
                <end-time>00:12:48,001</end-time>
                <translation>其本身并非善</translation>
                <original>善なるのではない</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="238" torder="1">
                <marks>
                    <mark top="">默认标记</mark>
                </marks>
                <start-time>00:12:48,001</start-time>
                <end-time>00:12:50,740</end-time>
                <translation>若违背了人格的要求</translation>
                <original>もし人格的要求に反したときには</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="239" torder="1">
                <marks>
                    <mark top="">默认标记</mark>
                </marks>
                <start-time>00:12:50,740</start-time>
                <end-time>00:12:52,773</end-time>
                <translation>反而会成为恶</translation>
                <original>かえって悪となる</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="240" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:12:52,773</start-time>
                <end-time>00:12:54,400</end-time>
                <translation>这是什么意思呢？</translation>
                <original>それはどういうことでしょうか</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="241" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:12:54,400</start-time>
                <end-time>00:12:56,220</end-time>
                <translation>人格的要求</translation>
                <original>人格的要求</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="242" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:12:56,220</start-time>
                <end-time>00:12:57,336</end-time>
                <translation>这个词也很难懂啊</translation>
                <original>これも難しいですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="243" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:12:57,336</start-time>
                <end-time>00:12:59,160</end-time>
                <translation>这也是我们现代人</translation>
                <original>これも現代の私たちには</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="244" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:12:59,160</start-time>
                <end-time>00:13:01,566</end-time>
                <translation>几乎不用的词语</translation>
                <original>およそ使わない言葉ですけど</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="245" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:13:01,566</start-time>
                <end-time>00:13:03,817</end-time>
                <translation>如果换个说法</translation>
                <original>言い換えるとすると</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="246" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:13:03,817</start-time>
                <end-time>00:13:07,109</end-time>
                <translation>我认为可以说是“尊重他者的存在”</translation>
                <original>他者の存在を尊ぶと言っていいと思います</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="247" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:13:07,109</start-time>
                <end-time>00:13:10,040</end-time>
                <translation>那么 如果不重视他者</translation>
                <original>じゃあ他者を大事に思わなかった場合は</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="248" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:13:10,040</start-time>
                <end-time>00:13:12,180</end-time>
                <translation>就会变成恶 可以这么理解吗？</translation>
                <original>悪になるよということでいいですか</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="249" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:13:12,180</start-time>
                <end-time>00:13:13,277</end-time>
                <translation>是的</translation>
                <original>そうですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="250" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:13:13,277</start-time>
                <end-time>00:13:14,100</end-time>
                <translation>不过 确实是这样呢</translation>
                <original>でもそうだよね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="251" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:13:14,100</start-time>
                <end-time>00:13:14,620</end-time>
                <translation>实际上 
実際</translation>
                <original/>
