            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="252" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:13:14,620</start-time>
                <end-time>00:13:15,674</end-time>
                <translation>很容易理解呢</translation>
                <original>分かりやすいですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="253" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:13:15,674</start-time>
                <end-time>00:13:18,628</end-time>
                <translation>在那里 想要为大家好的想法</translation>
                <original>そこでみんなによくしようと思うことは</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="254" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:13:18,671</start-time>
                <end-time>00:13:19,894</end-time>
                <translation>虽然是善</translation>
                <original>善だけど</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="255" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:13:19,894</start-time>
                <end-time>00:13:21,511</end-time>
                <translation>但因为拥有了权力</translation>
                <original>権力を持ったことで</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="256" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:13:21,511</start-time>
                <end-time>00:13:25,444</end-time>
                <translation>如果想要蹂躏他人 那显而易见就是恶</translation>
                <original>他を蹂躙しようと思えばそれは分かりやすく悪だから</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="257" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:13:25,444</start-time>
                <end-time>00:13:27,848</end-time>
                <translation>这一点很容易理解呢</translation>
                <original>ここは分かりやすいですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="258" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:13:27,848</start-time>
                <end-time>00:13:30,536</end-time>
                <translation>因此 所谓绝对的善行 
そこで絶対的善行とは</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="259" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:13:30,536</start-time>
                <end-time>00:13:33,748</end-time>
                <translation>必须是以人格的实现本身为目的</translation>
                <original>人格の実現そのものを目的とした</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="260" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:13:33,748</start-time>
                <end-time>00:13:39,014</end-time>
                <translation>即 必须是为了意识统一本身而行动的行为</translation>
                <original>すなわち意識統一そのもののために働いた行為でなければならぬ</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="261" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:13:39,014</start-time>
                <end-time>00:13:40,860</end-time>
                <translation>这个“意识”这个词</translation>
                <original>この意識という言葉が</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="262" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:13:40,860</start-time>
                <end-time>00:13:44,739</end-time>
                <translation>在西田说来 是包含刚才提到的普遍无意识的</translation>
                <original>西田が言うときにはさっきの言った普遍的無意識まで</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="263" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:13:44,739</start-time>
                <end-time>00:13:46,858</end-time>
                <translation>连无意识都包含了的意识</translation>
                <original>含むものなんですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="264" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:13:46,858</start-time>
                <end-time>00:13:49,349</end-time>
                <translation>可以这样换种说法吧</translation>
                <original>こう言い換えればいいんですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="265" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:13:49,349</start-time>
                <end-time>00:13:51,993</end-time>
                <translation>也就是说 必须是为了普遍无意识</translation>
                <original>ですのですなわち普遍的無意識のために</original>
