                <start-time>00:13:54,397</start-time>
                <end-time>00:13:57,216</end-time>
                <translation>所以 并非是对我个人有利</translation>
                <original>ですので私にとって得であるとか</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="268" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:13:57,216</start-time>
                <end-time>00:13:58,548</end-time>
                <translation>或者呢</translation>
                <original>あるいはですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="269" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:13:58,548</start-time>
                <end-time>00:14:01,580</end-time>
                <translation>比如说 对我们这个狭小世界里的我们</translation>
                <original>例えば私たちこの狭い世界の私たち</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="270" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:14:01,580</start-time>
                <end-time>00:14:03,858</end-time>
                <translation>仅仅对我们家人有利之类的</translation>
                <original>私たちの家族だけにとって得だとか</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="271" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:14:03,858</start-time>
                <end-time>00:14:06,852</end-time>
                <translation>并非如此 而是在更深处</translation>
                <original>いうことではなくてもっと深いところの</original>
                <spell/>
