            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="301" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:15:21,385</start-time>
                <end-time>00:15:23,400</end-time>
                <translation>就是深化自我</translation>
                <original>自己を深めていくことです</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="302" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:15:26,393</start-time>
                <end-time>00:15:28,312</end-time>
                <translation>深化自我</translation>
                <original>自己を深めると</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="303" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:15:28,312</start-time>
                <end-time>00:15:33,316</end-time>
                <translation>相应地 自己就会向他人敞开</translation>
                <original>それだけ自分が他者に開かれていきます</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="304" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:15:33,316</start-time>
                <end-time>00:15:37,074</end-time>
                <translation>当这种敞开达到最深时</translation>
                <original>その開かれ方が最も深くなった時</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="305" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:15:37,074</start-time>
                <end-time>00:15:39,920</end-time>
                <translation>就会与全人类相连</translation>
                <original>それは人類にまでつながるのです</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="306" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:15:43,481</start-time>
                <end-time>00:15:45,028</end-time>
                <translation>人类之中
人類の中には</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="307" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:15:45,028</start-time>
                <end-time>00:15:47,759</end-time>
                <translation>不仅包括同时代的人</translation>
                <original>同時代の人間だけでなく</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="308" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:15:47,759</start-time>
                <end-time>00:15:50,862</end-time>
                <translation>也包括过去和未来
過去や未来も含みます</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="309" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:15:50,862</start-time>
                <end-time>00:15:52,360</end-time>
                <translation>完全的善行
完全なる善行は</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="310" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:15:52,360</start-time>
                <end-time>00:15:56,480</end-time>
                <translation>会升华为对无限宏大之物的爱</translation>
                <original>果てしなく大きなものへの愛に昇華するのです</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="311" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:15:59,866</start-time>
                <end-time>00:16:01,853</end-time>
                <translation>如此宏大的善行</translation>
                <original>そんな壮大なる善行は</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="312" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:16:01,853</start-time>
                <end-time>00:16:05,043</end-time>
                <translation>看似极为困难</translation>
                <original>極めて難しいように思えますが</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="313" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:16:05,043</start-time>
                <end-time>00:16:08,740</end-time>
                <translation>但西田说 这是任何人都能做到的</translation>
                <original>誰にでもできると西田は言います</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="314" torder="1">
                <marks>
                    <mark top="">默认标记</mark>
                </marks>
                <start-time>00:16:12,957</start-time>
                <end-time>00:16:14,308</end-time>
                <translation>如此这般</translation>
                <original>かくのごとき</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="315" torder="1">
                <marks>
                    <mark top="">默认标记</mark>
                </marks>
                <start-time>00:16:14,308</start-time>
                <end-time>00:16:16,493</end-time>
                <translation>完全的善行
完全なる善行は</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="316" torder="1">
                <marks>
                    <mark top="">默认标记</mark>
                </marks>
                <start-time>00:16:16,493</start-time>
                <end-time>00:16:20,514</end-time>
                <translation>从一方面看似乎极为困难</translation>
                <original>一方より見れば極めて難事のようであるが</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="317" torder="1">
                <marks>
                    <mark top="">默认标记</mark>
                </marks>
                <start-time>00:16:20,514</start-time>
                <end-time>00:16:25,140</end-time>
                <translation>但从另一方面看 也必须是任何人都能做到的事</translation>
                <original>また一方より見れば誰にもできなければならぬことである</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="318" torder="1">
                <marks>
                    <mark top="">默认标记</mark>
                </marks>
                <start-time>00:16:27,434</start-time>
                <end-time>00:16:29,123</end-time>
                <translation>所谓道德</translation>
                <original>道徳のことは</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="319" torder="1">
                <marks>
                    <mark top="">默认标记</mark>
                </marks>
                <start-time>00:16:29,123</start-time>
                <end-time>00:16:33,209</end-time>
                <translation>并非向外寻求自身之外的东西</translation>
                <original>自己の外にあるものを求めるのではない</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="320" torder="1">
                <marks>
                    <mark top="">默认标记</mark>
                </marks>
                <start-time>00:16:33,209</start-time>
                <end-time>00:16:37,180</end-time>
                <translation>而只是去发现自身内在已有的东西</translation>
                <original>ただ自己にあるものを見出すのである</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="321" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:16:39,408</start-time>
                <end-time>00:16:42,976</end-time>
                <translation>感觉一下子就豁然开朗了</translation>
                <original>何かすごく腑に落ちてきましたね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="322" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:16:42,976</start-time>
                <end-time>00:16:46,407</end-time>
                <translation>从规模上来说 确实变得相当宏大啊</translation>
                <original>規模としては相当壮大になってきますよね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="323" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:16:46,407</start-time>
                <end-time>00:16:49,750</end-time>
                <translation>虽然我认为首先要从自身做起</translation>
                <original>自分サイズでまずやっていくことではあると思うんだけど</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="324" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:16:49,750</start-time>
                <end-time>00:16:52,920</end-time>
                <translation>从为家人着想开始</translation>
                <original>家族にとってみたいことから始まり</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="325" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:16:52,920</start-time>
                <end-time>00:16:54,579</end-time>
                <translation>然后也包括邻居</translation>
                <original>お隣さんも含めてってなり</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="326" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:16:54,579</start-time>
                <end-time>00:16:57,835</end-time>
                <translation>感觉会一直扩展到世界乃至宇宙</translation>
                <original>世界まで宇宙まで行くんだろうなという感じがしますけど</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="327" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:16:57,835</start-time>
                <end-time>00:17:00,566</end-time>
                <translation>西田的哲学乍一看
西田の哲学は少し一見すると</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="328" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:17:00,566</start-time>
                <end-time>00:17:03,385</end-time>
                <translation>我觉得会给人一种向内挖掘自我的印象</translation>
                <original>なんか私を掘っていくようなイメージがあるんだと思うんですけど</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="329" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:17:03,385</start-time>
                <end-time>00:17:05,657</end-time>
                <translation>但其实是迅速超越自我</translation>
                <original>私を早々に超えて</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="330" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:17:05,657</start-time>
                <end-time>00:17:08,327</end-time>
                <translation>走向我们人类、宇宙的所在</translation>
                <original>私たち人類宇宙とところへ</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="331" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:17:08,327</start-time>
                <end-time>00:17:12,060</end-time>
                <translation>这就是西田的想法吧</translation>
                <original>行けっていうのが西田の考えなんですよね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="332" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:17:12,060</start-time>
                <end-time>00:17:15,272</end-time>
                <translation>看到孩子开心的笑脸时 我们就会觉得快乐嘛？</translation>
                <original>子供が喜ぶ顔を見てるとき楽しいじゃないですか</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="333" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:17:15,272</start-time>
                <end-time>00:17:17,741</end-time>
                <translation>确实很快乐呢 而这里大概是说</translation>
                <original>楽しいですよねこれは多分</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="334" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:17:17,741</start-time>
                <end-time>00:17:20,973</end-time>
                <translation>就是挖到孩子和自己都很好地连接在了一起</translation>
                <original>子供も自分もうまく繋がってる</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="335" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:17:20,973</start-time>
                <end-time>00:17:22,679</end-time>
                <translation>挖掘到了那么深层的地方</translation>
                <original>地層まで掘れたところだと思うんだよね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="336" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:17:22,679</start-time>
                <end-time>00:17:26,300</end-time>
                <translation>如果孩子的朋友心情也好
子供のお友達の機嫌もいい方が</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="337" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:17:26,300</start-time>
                <end-time>00:17:29,760</end-time>
                <translation>大概孩子也会更开心 这样和他连接起来</translation>
                <original>おそらく子供も喜ぶっていうことで繋がっていくと</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="338" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:17:29,760</start-time>
                <end-time>00:17:32,317</end-time>
                <translation>大概朋友的妈妈也会开心</translation>
                <original>多分お友達のお母さんも</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="339" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:17:32,317</start-time>
                <end-time>00:17:34,391</end-time>
                <translation>会因为相关的的一些事 大家关联起来</translation>
                <original>みたいことにも多分繋がっていく</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="340" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:17:34,391</start-time>
                <end-time>00:17:36,020</end-time>
                <translation>像这样不断深挖下去</translation>
                <original>そうやって掘っていくごとに</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="341" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:17:36,020</start-time>
                <end-time>00:17:37,647</end-time>
                <translation>总觉得下面的部分啊</translation>
                <original>なんか下の方はさ</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="342" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:17:37,647</start-time>
                <end-time>00:17:40,680</end-time>
                <translation>就像红薯一样 紧密地连在一起的感觉</translation>
                <original>お芋みたいにすごい繋がってるみたいな感じの</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="343" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:17:40,680</start-time>
                <end-time>00:17:45,142</end-time>
                <translation>或许可以说是全部由藤蔓连接在一起的感觉吧</translation>
                <original>もう全部つるで繋がってる感じっていうのかな</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="344" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:17:45,142</start-time>
                <end-time>00:17:47,481</end-time>
                <translation>西田进一步这样说道</translation>
                <original>西田はさらにこう言っています</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="345" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:17:49,556</start-time>
                <end-time>00:17:54,450</end-time>
                <translation>道德之事 并非寻求自身之外的东西</translation>
                <original>道徳のことは自己の外にあるものを求むるのではない</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="346" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:17:54,450</start-time>
                <end-time>00:17:57,750</end-time>
                <translation>而只是发现自身之中已有的东西</translation>
                <original>ただ自己にあるものを見出すのである</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="347" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:17:57,750</start-time>
                <end-time>00:17:58,820</end-time>
                <translation>这是什么意思呢？</translation>
                <original>これはどういうことですか</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="348" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:17:58,820</start-time>
                <end-time>00:18:00,846</end-time>
                <translation>这一点说得极其简明扼要
これは大変端的に</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="349" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:18:00,846</start-time>
                <end-time>00:18:03,693</end-time>
                <translation>西田也很难得地说得如此简明扼要</translation>
                <original>西田も珍しく端的に言ってくれてますけども</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="350" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:18:03,693</start-time>
                <end-time>00:18:05,551</end-time>
                <translation>因为是去发现</translation>
                <original>発見するわけですから</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="351" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:18:05,551</start-time>
                <end-time>00:18:07,233</end-time>
                <translation>所以它原本就存在呢</translation>
                <original>あるわけですよね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="352" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:18:07,233</start-time>
                <end-time>00:18:12,780</end-time>
                <translation>也就是说 善并非我们努力创造出来的东西</translation>
                <original>善というものは私たちが努力して作り上げていくものではなくて</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="353" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:18:12,780</start-time>
                <end-time>00:18:17,525</end-time>
                <translation>而是去发现原本就存在的东西呢</translation>
                <original>すでにあるものを発見していくことなのだということですよね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="354" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:18:17,525</start-time>
                <end-time>00:18:20,340</end-time>
                <translation>对我们来说 或许比起“善”这个词</translation>
                <original>私たちもしかしたら善という言葉よりも</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="355" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:18:20,340</start-time>
                <end-time>00:18:23,040</end-time>
                <translation>换成“生存的意义”会更容易理解一些吧</translation>
                <original>生きる意味ぐらいに変えると少し分かりやすいですかね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="356" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:18:25,465</start-time>
                <end-time>00:18:27,960</end-time>
                <translation>生存的意义已经存在于我们心中</translation>
                <original>生きる意味がもう私たちの中にあって</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="357" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:18:27,960</start-time>
                <end-time>00:18:30,140</end-time>
                <translation>我们是去发现它</translation>
                <original>それを私たちが見つけていくのであって</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="358" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:18:30,140</start-time>
                <end-time>00:18:32,244</end-time>
                <translation>而不是去创造生存的意义</translation>
                <original>生きる意味を作っていくんじゃないんだ</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="359" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:18:32,244</start-time>
                <end-time>00:18:33,542</end-time>
                <translation>这就是西田想表达的</translation>
                <original>ということなんですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="360" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:18:37,191</start-time>
                <end-time>00:18:42,523</end-time>
                <translation>西田在第三编“善”的结尾这样总结道</translation>
                <original>第3編善の最後を西田はこう締めくくっています</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="361" torder="1">
                <marks>
                    <mark top="">默认标记</mark>
                </marks>
                <start-time>00:18:45,232</start-time>
                <end-time>00:18:49,099</end-time>
                <translation>在最后 我想说一句</translation>
                <original>終わりに臨んで一言しておく</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="362" torder="1">
                <marks>
                    <mark top="">默认标记</mark>
                </marks>
                <start-time>00:18:49,099</start-time>
                <end-time>00:18:54,213</end-time>
                <translation>从学问上解释善 可以有各种各样的说明</translation>
                <original>善を学問的に説明すればいろいろな説明はできるが</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="363" torder="1">
                <marks>
                    <mark top="">默认标记</mark>
                </marks>
                <start-time>00:18:54,213</start-time>
                <end-time>00:19:00,069</end-time>
                <translation>但实际上 真正的善只有一个</translation>
                <original>実地上真の善とはただ一つあるのみである</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="364" torder="1">
                <marks>
                    <mark top="">默认标记</mark>
                </marks>
                <start-time>00:19:00,069</start-time>
                <end-time>00:19:04,658</end-time>
                <translation>那就是完全了解真正的自我</translation>
                <original>すなわち真の自己を知るというに尽きている</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="365" torder="1">
                <marks>
                    <mark top="">默认标记</mark>
                </marks>
                <start-time>00:19:06,209</start-time>
                <end-time>00:19:11,628</end-time>
                <translation>我们真正的自我 即是宇宙的本体
我々の真の自己は宇宙の本体である</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="366" torder="1">
                <marks>
                    <mark top="">默认标记</mark>
                </marks>
                <start-time>00:19:11,628</start-time>
                <end-time>00:19:13,360</end-time>
                <translation>若能了解真正的自我
真の自己を知れば</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="367" torder="1">
                <marks>
                    <mark top="">默认标记</mark>
                </marks>
                <start-time>00:19:13,360</start-time>
                <end-time>00:19:17,855</end-time>
                <translation>不仅与人类普遍的善相契合</translation>
                <original>ただに人類一般の善と合するばかりでなく</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="368" torder="1">
                <marks>
                    <mark top="">默认标记</mark>
                </marks>
                <start-time>00:19:17,855</start-time>
                <end-time>00:19:23,646</end-time>
                <translation>更能与宇宙的本体融合 与神意冥合
宇宙の本体と融合し神意と冥合するのである</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="369" torder="1">
                <marks>
                    <mark top="">默认标记</mark>
                </marks>
                <start-time>00:19:23,646</start-time>
                <end-time>00:19:28,737</end-time>
                <translation>宗教与道德 其实都归结于此</translation>
                <original>宗教も道徳も実にここに尽きている</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="370" torder="1">
                <marks>
                    <mark top="">默认标记</mark>
                </marks>
                <start-time>00:19:28,737</start-time>
                <end-time>00:19:31,512</end-time>
                <translation>而认识真正的自我</translation>
                <original>しかして真の自己を知り</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="371" torder="1">
                <marks>
                    <mark top="">默认标记</mark>
                </marks>
                <start-time>00:19:31,512</start-time>
                <end-time>00:19:33,260</end-time>
                <translation>与神合一的方法</translation>
                <original>神と合する方は</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="372" torder="1">
                <marks>
                    <mark top="">默认标记</mark>
                </marks>
                <start-time>00:19:33,260</start-time>
                <end-time>00:19:37,760</end-time>
                <translation>只在于自得主客合一之力</translation>
                <original>ただ主脚合一の力を自得するにあるのみである</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="373" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:19:40,578</start-time>
                <end-time>00:19:45,300</end-time>
                <translation>然后 西田介绍了这样一则轶事</translation>
                <original>そして西田はこんな逸話を紹介しています</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="374" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:19:45,300</start-time>
                <end-time>00:19:47,376</end-time>
                <translation>据说中世纪的画家乔托</translation>
                <original>中世の画家ジョットは</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="375" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:19:47,376</start-time>
                <end-time>00:19:52,358</end-time>
                <translation>在罗马教皇面前被要求展示画技时</translation>
                <original>ローマ法王の前で画力を見せよと命じられた時</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="376" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:19:52,358</start-time>
                <end-time>00:19:57,078</end-time>
                <translation>只画了一个圆</translation>
                <original>ただ一円を描いたといいます</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="377" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:19:57,078</start-time>
                <end-time>00:20:01,360</end-time>
                <translation>一个简单却无法描绘的完美圆形</translation>
                <original>シンプルで描けることのない丸い円</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="378" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:20:01,360</start-time>
                <end-time>00:20:03,698</end-time>
                <translation>我们在道德上 
我々は道徳の上で</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="379" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:20:03,698</start-time>
                <end-time>00:20:07,435</end-time>
                <translation>必须获得乔托的这个“一圆”</translation>
                <original>このジョットの一円形を得ねばならない</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="380" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:20:07,435</start-time>
                <end-time>00:20:11,140</end-time>
                <translation>到此 关于“善”的章节便结束了</translation>
                <original>と書いて善についての章は終わっています</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="381" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:20:16,406</start-time>
                <end-time>00:20:22,840</end-time>
                <translation>这个“与宇宙的本体融合  与神意冥合”</translation>
                <original>こちら宇宙の本体と融合し神意と冥合するのである</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="382" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:20:22,840</start-time>
                <end-time>00:20:24,440</end-time>
                <translation>这是什么意思呢？</translation>
                <original>これどういうことですか</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="383" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:20:24,440</start-time>
                <end-time>00:20:28,420</end-time>
                <translation>是啊 乍一看似乎很宏大</translation>
                <original>そうですね一見すると壮大に見えるんですけど</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="384" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:20:28,420</start-time>
                <end-time>00:20:33,022</end-time>
                <translation>但首先我们自己就是宇宙的一部分呢</translation>
                <original>まず私たち自身が宇宙の一部ですよね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="385" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:20:33,022</start-time>
                <end-time>00:20:35,185</end-time>
                <translation>这里也是宇宙</translation>
                <original>ここも宇宙なんです</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="386" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:20:35,185</start-time>
                <end-time>00:20:38,360</end-time>
                <translation>而现代人因为能坐火箭去宇宙了</translation>
                <original>で現代人はやっぱり宇宙にロケットで行けるようになって</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="387" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:20:38,360</start-time>
                <end-time>00:20:41,631</end-time>
                <translation>反而忘记了这里就是宇宙</translation>
                <original>ここが宇宙だってことを忘れちゃったんですよ</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="388" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:20:41,631</start-time>
                <end-time>00:20:44,480</end-time>
                <translation>因此 当我们解读西田的哲学时</translation>
                <original>ですので西田の哲学を我々が読み解くときに</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="389" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:20:44,480</start-time>
                <end-time>00:20:45,586</end-time>
                <translation>会出现“人类”
人類とか</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="390" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:20:45,586</start-time>
                <end-time>00:20:48,077</end-time>
                <translation>因为我们终究是人类</translation>
                <original>我々はやっぱり人類なんです</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="391" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:20:48,077</start-time>
                <end-time>00:20:49,540</end-time>
                <translation>然后是宇宙这个词呢</translation>
                <original>で宇宙ですよね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="392" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:20:49,540</start-time>
                <end-time>00:20:51,137</end-time>
                <translation>我们就是宇宙</translation>
                <original>我々宇宙なんです</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="393" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:20:51,137</start-time>
                <end-time>00:20:54,000</end-time>
                <translation>所以这两个词用现代语言来替换的话</translation>
                <original>ですのでその現代の言葉に置き換えるとすると</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="394" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:20:54,000</start-time>
                <end-time>00:20:56,820</end-time>
                <translation>我觉得果然还是“无限”吧</translation>
                <original>やっぱり無限ってことかなと思いますやっぱり</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="395" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:20:56,820</start-time>
                <end-time>00:20:58,280</end-time>
                <translation>与无限融合 
無限と融合</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="396" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:20:58,280</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:01,800</end-time>
                <translation>是的 与神意冥合</translation>
                <original>はい真意と名合する</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="397" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:21:01,800</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:03,985</end-time>
                <translation>我觉得这里也很难理解吧</translation>
                <original>ここも分かりにくいんだと思うんですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="398" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:21:03,985</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:07,131</end-time>
                <translation>西田所说的“神” 正如我们刚才所讨论的</translation>
                <original>西田における神ってのは先ほどからお話ししているように</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="399" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:21:07,131</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:09,601</end-time>
                <translation>是指一种“伟大的存在”</translation>
                <original>大いなるものということなんですけど</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="400" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:21:09,601</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:11,829</end-time>
                <translation>但这里非常重要的一点是</translation>
                <original>やっぱりここで大変重要なのは</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="401" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:21:11,829</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:15,959</end-time>
                <translation>我认为是在超越语言的世界中合而为一</translation>
                <original>言葉を超えた世界で一つになるってことだと思うんです</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="402" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:21:15,959</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:18,843</end-time>
                <translation>因此 当我们超越语言</translation>
                <original>ですので私たちが言葉を超えて</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="403" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:21:18,843</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:21,246</end-time>
                <translation>与无限合而为一的时候</translation>
                <original>無限と一つになるということに</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="404" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:21:21,246</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:26,295</end-time>
                <translation>我们就能从中发现所谓的“善”</translation>
                <original>私たちは善というものを見出すことができるんだということですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="405" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:21:26,295</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:29,135</end-time>
                <translation>从刚才的图示来看 所谓无限</translation>
                <original>無限というのは先ほどの図から言うと</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="406" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:21:29,135</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:30,315</end-time>
                <translation>也可以是“人类”</translation>
                <original>人類でもいいんです</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="407" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:21:30,315</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:32,806</end-time>
                <translation>当我们向这类事物敞开自身时</translation>
                <original>そういうものに開かれていったときに</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="408" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:21:32,806</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:35,327</end-time>
                <translation>我们就能去追求</translation>
                <original>私たちは本当の善というものを</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="409" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:21:35,327</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:38,160</end-time>
                <translation>真正的“善”</translation>
                <original>求めることができるんだということです</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="410" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:21:38,160</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:39,558</end-time>
                <translation>还有 那个画圆</translation>
                <original>そしてあの丸</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="411" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:21:39,558</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:43,220</end-time>
                <translation>对 就是那个“画圆”的轶事</translation>
                <original>そうでしたねくるという</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="412" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:21:43,220</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:45,676</end-time>
                <translation>关于“圆”的轶事 是什么意思呢？</translation>
                <original>縁の逸話はどういう意味なんでしょう</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="413" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:21:45,676</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:49,304</end-time>
                <translation>它讲的是非常朴素的事情</translation>
                <original>大変素朴なことだということですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="414" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:21:49,304</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:51,420</end-time>
                <translation>所以 并不是说要成功地画出一朵玫瑰</translation>
                <original>でのでバラの絵を成功に描くとか</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="415" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:21:51,420</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:53,149</end-time>
                <translation>或者类似的事情</translation>
                <original>そういうことではないんだ</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="416" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:21:53,149</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:55,291</end-time>
                <translation>能够画出完美的圆</translation>
                <original>完全な縁を描けるという</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="417" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:21:55,291</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:57,220</end-time>
                <translation>在这种朴素的行为之中
この素朴な行為の中に</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="418" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:21:57,220</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:00,513</end-time>
                <translation>包含着所有的要素</translation>
                <original>あらゆる要素があるんだということです</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="419" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:22:00,513</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:01,880</end-time>
                <translation>在这边呢</translation>
                <original>こちらにですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="420" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:22:01,880</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:05,277</end-time>
                <translation>还有西田画的“圆”的图示</translation>
                <original>西田の描いた縁の図もあるんですよ</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="421" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:22:05,277</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:06,700</end-time>
                <translation>他留下了这样的东西呢</translation>
                <original>こういうものを残してるんですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="422" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:22:06,700</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:09,100</end-time>
                <translation>是的 不仅是西田</translation>
                <original>そうですね西田だけではなくて</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="423" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:22:09,100</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:13,121</end-time>
                <translation>禅宗的僧侣们也经常画这个“圆”</translation>
                <original>禅のお坊さんたちはしばしばこの縁を描いたりします</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="424" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:22:13,121</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:15,809</end-time>
                <translation>我想可以有各种各样的解释</translation>
                <original>いろんな解釈ができるんだと思うんですけど</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="425" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:22:15,809</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:19,130</end-time>
                <translation>“圆”真的是非常朴素的东西呢</translation>
                <original>園というのは本当に大変素朴なものですよね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="426" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:22:19,130</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:22,280</end-time>
                <translation>因此 当我们在追求善的时候</translation>
                <original>ですので私たちが善を求めていくときも</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="427" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:22:22,280</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:26,843</end-time>
                <translation>它也不是什么复杂的、必须用许多语言去说明的东西</translation>
                <original>複雑なもう何か多くの言葉を持って説明しなきゃいけないものではなくて</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="428" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:22:26,843</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:29,881</end-time>
                <translation>善就体现在极为朴素的行为之中
大変素朴な行為の中に善が現れるんだ</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="429" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:22:29,881</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:34,382</end-time>
                <translation>我认为西田是想向我们传达这一点</translation>
                <original>ということは西田は私たちに伝えようとしてくれてると思いますけどね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="430" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:22:34,382</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:36,414</end-time>
                <translation>这么一想 “圆”真是有趣啊</translation>
                <original>そう考えると縁は面白いな</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="431" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:22:36,414</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:39,520</end-time>
                <translation>感觉现在就算我想画个圆 也会相当扭曲</translation>
                <original>なんか自分が今縁描こうと思ってもかなり歪</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="432" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:22:39,520</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:41,680</end-time>
                <translation>因为一用力 画出来的圆绝对会变形</translation>
                <original>力むから絶対いびつになるし</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="433" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:22:41,680</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:44,674</end-time>
                <translation>而且会把力气都用在“画圆”这件事本身上</translation>
                <original>縁を描こうということに力が入るし</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="434" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:22:44,674</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:49,022</end-time>
                <translation>大概也会因为想着“还差一点就接上了”之类的事</translation>
                <original>もうちょっとで結ばれるんだということとかで多分</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="435" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:22:49,022</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:51,032</end-time>
                <translation>导致线条变得断断续续的吧</translation>
                <original>かすれたりするんだろうけど</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="436" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:22:51,032</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:54,800</end-time>
                <translation>恐怕在最为放松的时候反而能画好</translation>
                <original>おそらく一番リラックスした時に描けたりとかするのは</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="437" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:22:54,800</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:01,127</end-time>
                <translation>“所谓圆 本来什么都不想就能画出来”这个道理</translation>
                <original>そのそもそも縁なんて何にも考えなきゃ描けるんだよっていうところが</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="438" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:23:01,127</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:03,415</end-time>
                <translation>是不是有点像刚才说的 那种人类最普遍的
さっきの一番人間の普遍的な</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="439" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:23:03,415</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:08,426</end-time>
                <translation>探寻内心深处流淌之物（纯粹经验）的行为呢</translation>
                <original>その深底に流れてるものを探す行為にちょっと似てるかしら</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="440" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:23:08,426</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:10,676</end-time>
                <translation>我想是的 确实如此</translation>
                <original>そうなんだと思いますそうだと思います</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="441" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:23:10,676</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:13,451</end-time>
                <translation>虽然我们不可能什么都不想</translation>
                <original>何も考えないわけにはいかないんだけども</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="442" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:23:13,451</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:16,140</end-time>
                <translation>但也不是光靠思考就能做到的</translation>
                <original>考えだけでやるのでもないんですよね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="443" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:23:16,140</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:17,400</end-time>
                <translation>所以这既困难</translation>
                <original>で難しくもあり</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="444" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:23:17,400</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:18,193</end-time>
                <translation>没错</translation>
                <original>そうなんです</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="445" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:23:18,193</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:19,500</end-time>
                <translation>又很简单</translation>
                <original>シンプルでもありっていう</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="446" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:23:21,903</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:26,103</end-time>
                <translation>我觉得我们果然是被某种存在所赋予生命的</translation>
                <original>やっぱり私たちは何者かに生かされてるんだと思うんですよ</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="447" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:23:26,103</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:29,206</end-time>
                <translation>因此 “要如何活下去”这一点固然非常重要</translation>
                <original>ですのでどう生きようかってこれもとても大事です</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="448" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:23:29,206</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:31,280</end-time>
                <translation>但“我们是如何被赋予生命而活着的”</translation>
                <original>しかしどう生かされてるのかって</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="449" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:23:31,280</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:33,554</end-time>
                <translation>我认为这一点也非常重要</translation>
                <original>こっちもとても大事だと思うんですよね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="450" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:23:33,554</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:35,680</end-time>
                <translation>所以 真的要把这两者</translation>
                <original>ですので本当にこの2つを</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="451" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:23:35,680</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:38,252</end-time>
                <translation>都好好思考才行</translation>
                <original>私たちは両方考えていかなくちゃいけないんじゃないか</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="452" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:23:38,252</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:40,262</end-time>
                <translation>我想大概就是这么一回事吧</translation>
                <original>ということじゃないかなと思いますけど</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="453" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:23:40,262</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:41,595</end-time>
                <translation>看来还有很多内容要讲呢</translation>
                <original>まだまだ先がありますね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="454" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:23:41,595</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:43,234</end-time>
                <translation>是啊</translation>
                <original>そうですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="455" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:23:43,234</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:45,220</end-time>
                <translation>若松老师 非常感谢你</translation>
                <original>若松さんありがとうございました</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" vertical="0" id="" time="" index="456" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:23:45,220</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:46,594</end-time>
                <translation>非常感谢</translation>
                <original>ありがとうございました</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
        </part>
    </body>
